	(property "Qualification" "Recommended normal VBUS 4.0-5.5V; absolute stress limits -0.3..22V. Positive transient overshoot shall remain below 22V and negative transient/reverse protection shall keep PMIC VBUS at or above -0.3V with design margin. Sustained reverse voltage requires series blocking; final clamps and series protection remain TBD against qualified dock/fault envelope; TVS standoff above dock maximum." (at 198.12 55.88 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes))))
